#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:5
#: 30bae1e0fb6b4218ab3681281b66cc3e
msgid "OEM Customization"
msgstr "OEM 定制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:7
#: 07f42d4a209b40db86d0227900907d24
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides several ways for an OEM to provide firmware on their "
"products that has been customized to their specific system configuration:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 为 OEM 提供多种方式，在其产品上提供针对特定系统配置定制的固件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:9
#: 9ebd5dd02672460dbc55e529660b812a
msgid ""
"Ability to have specific defaults for parameters to match included system "
"components, such as gimbals, or entire systems' peripherals, such as in "
"ready-to-fly vehicles. This allows the user to \"reset to defaults\" using "
"Mission Planner or MAVProxy in case of a problem with parameters having been"
" accidentally changed, and only have to re-calibrate compass/IMU/and RC, at "
"most, to be ready to fly."
msgstr ""
"能够为特定参数设置匹配所含系统组件（如云台）或整个系统外设（如即飞飞行器）的默认值。这使用户在参数被意外更改时，可以使用 Mission Planner"
" 或 MAVProxy「恢复默认值」，最多只需重新校准罗盘/IMU 和 RC 即可准备飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:10
#: 07c2b569728c4bb19bc851842019fa11
msgid ""
"Ability to provide Lua scripts in ROM for special functions without the end-"
"user having to load them on the SD card. Read more about Lua scripting in "
"ArduPilot :ref:`here<common-lua-scripts>`."
msgstr ""
"能够在 ROM 中提供 Lua 脚本以实现特殊功能，无需最终用户将其加载到 SD 卡上。了解更多关于 ArduPilot Lua 脚本的内容，请参阅 "
":ref:`此处<common-lua-scripts>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:11
#: a6eac98d109e48969f133e700ad73356
msgid "Ability to change the firmware string displayed to the user."
msgstr "能够更改向用户显示的固件字符串。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:12
#: 906dfd7e46ac43cfa13100e5ee171c30
msgid ""
"Ability to include pictures and informational files in available free flash "
"space."
msgstr "能够在可用的空闲 Flash 空间中包含图片和信息文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:13
#: 2f32f27098664643beb2a9699780b76d
msgid ""
"Ability to change parameters and mark them as read-only so that users cannot"
" change them using :ref:`APJ Tools<dev:apjtools-intro>`. (as of version 4.5 "
"firmware, this is no longer available)"
msgstr ""
"能够使用 :ref:`APJ Tools<dev:apjtools-intro>` 更改参数并将其标记为只读，使用户无法更改它们。（从 4.5 "
"版固件开始，此功能不再可用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:16
#: 6ccd69dd0ca84a7b8d57b39352927340
msgid "Customization Steps"
msgstr "定制步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:18
#: aedf2c9a58c5442390f2cf25465ca9d5
msgid ""
"This section assumes that the OEM has set up the build environment "
"(:ref:`building-the-code`) and cloned the ArduPilot GitHub repo locally "
"(:ref:`where-to-get-the-code`), to build its customized version of the "
"firmware."
msgstr ""
"本节假设 OEM 已搭建好编译环境（:ref:`building-the-code`）并在本地克隆了 ArduPilot GitHub "
"仓库（:ref:`where-to-get-the-code`），以编译其定制版固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:20
#: 81e687d3deb74d1487866a1f6ddae5bd
msgid ""
"Create a branch with the version of firmware you wish to base the "
"customization upon. This will usually be the current stable version. To do "
"this for ArduPlane Stable, for example, assuming you are already in the "
"ArduPilot directory on your PC:"
msgstr ""
"创建一个分支，以您希望基于的固件版本为基础进行定制。通常这将是当前稳定版本。例如，要对 ArduPlane 稳定版执行此操作，假设您已在 PC 上的 "
"ArduPilot 目录中："

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:32
#: 74dc740e685b449698a7d694241ca925
msgid ""
"In the ``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef`` directory, create a new "
"subdirectory for your customized board definitions. In this example, the "
"directory will be named ``OEM_CubeOrange`` to create a derivative for that "
"board."
msgstr ""
"在 ``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef`` 目录中，为您的定制板定义创建一个新子目录。在本例中，目录命名为 "
"``OEM_CubeOrange``，以创建该板的衍生版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:34
#: 1f31e7a3e72e4f79973992c45bfbad70
msgid ""
"Create a new ``hwdef.dat`` file in this format. In this case, our ready-to-"
"fly plane will be using a CubeOrange autopilot and only requires a single "
"line:"
msgstr "按此格式创建一个新的 ``hwdef.dat`` 文件。在本例中，我们的即飞固定翼将使用 CubeOrange 飞控，只需一行："

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:40
#: cd2977cca8f843d89e7d5d21758aca90
msgid ""
"The firmware name can be customized by adding one line to the ``hwdef.dat`` "
"file."
msgstr "可以通过向 ``hwdef.dat`` 文件添加一行来定制固件名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:46
#: 322e8e10b56c49aba2bbceefcd32413b
msgid ""
"Custom frame type strings can be created through Lua the scripting method "
"``motors:set_frame_string(\"Custom frame name\")``."
msgstr ""
"可以通过 Lua 脚本方法 ``motors:set_frame_string(\"Custom frame name\")`` "
"创建自定义机架类型字符串。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:48
#: d9fff59de97c486cb5a765e7c9ef557a
msgid ""
"Now in that same directory, copy the base board's ``hwdef-bl.dat`` "
"bootloader file, and then include a file named ``defaults.parm``. This file "
"will be the parameter overrides of the standard defaults to match your "
"system's configuration. Things like output function assignments, auxiliary "
"RC switches, flight and tuning parameters, etc."
msgstr ""
"现在在同一目录中，复制基础板的 ``hwdef-bl.dat`` 引导程序文件，然后包含一个名为 ``defaults.parm`` "
"的文件。此文件将是对标准默认值的参数覆盖，以匹配您系统的配置，包括输出功能分配、辅助 RC 开关、飞行和调参参数等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:50
#: fd0c3e0cac6c447ba2824b23828c6203
msgid ""
"a parameter can be made readonly (ie user cannot change its value) by "
"marking it ``@READONLY`` in the file"
msgstr "可以通过在文件中标记 ``@READONLY`` 将参数设为只读（即用户无法更改其值）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:52
#: 5faa564ddfaf4262b74f6a4d1c369476
msgid ""
"The ``defaults.parm`` file should be as small as possible. Some boards only "
"allow 1024 bytes total for this file. Every ASCII byte in the file counts "
"against this limit (except for comment lines). Use integer values where "
"possible. Below is a simple example. Serial port protcols,baud rate,and "
"options defaults can be set directly in the hwdef, as well as NTF_LED_TYPES,"
" and battery monitor defaults, and should be done there instead of a "
"defaults file."
msgstr ""
"``defaults.parm`` 文件应尽可能小。某些板对此文件总大小限制为 1024 字节。文件中的每个 ASCII "
"字节均计入此限制（注释行除外）。尽量使用整数值。以下是一个简单示例。串口协议、波特率和选项默认值可以直接在 hwdef "
"中设置，NTF_LED_TYPES、电池监控器默认值也应在那里设置，而不是在 defaults 文件中设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:60
#: 87f31f008f894b9ab159f122af32377c
msgid ""
"You can also embed :ref:`Lua scripts<common-lua-scripts>` in the ROM of the "
"chip that will automatically run. Since Lua is currently only run on "
"autopilots with a lot of flash space, they are only restricted in total "
"aggregate size to available free flash memory. Put the scripts in a sub-"
"directory called ``scripts``, i.e. "
"``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange/scripts``. Files must end in"
" ``.lua``."
msgstr ""
"您还可以在芯片的 ROM 中嵌入 :ref:`Lua 脚本<common-lua-scripts>`，它们将自动运行。由于 Lua 目前仅在具有大量 "
"Flash 空间的飞控上运行，它们仅受可用空闲 Flash 内存总量限制。将脚本放在名为 ``scripts`` 的子目录中，即 "
"``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange/scripts``。文件必须以 ``.lua`` 结尾。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:62
#: 1f36a26a6d5d486488b8be66252c8363
msgid ""
"The user may also run Lua scripts off the SD card, so care should be taken "
"in naming the embedded script file names to not conflict with potential user"
" file names. It is recommended that the file names of embedded Lua scripts "
"be provided in the product documentation for the user."
msgstr ""
"用户也可以从 SD 卡运行 Lua 脚本，因此应注意命名嵌入式脚本文件名，避免与潜在的用户文件名冲突。建议在产品文档中向用户提供嵌入式 Lua "
"脚本的文件名。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:64
#: 3fc50fc3d42d47dca1b254d49e4044db
msgid ""
"You can also imbed small pieces of documentation in the ROM of the chip that"
" are readable when examining the @ROMFS folder via MAVFtp. These can be "
"pictures or small informational documents. These must fit within the free "
"flash space of the autopilot. These files can be located in sub-directories "
"in ``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange`` (e.g. "
"``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange/AircraftManual``)."
msgstr ""
"您还可以在芯片的 ROM 中嵌入小型文档，通过 MAVFtp 访问 @ROMFS 文件夹时可以查看。这些可以是图片或小型信息文档，必须适合飞控的空闲 "
"Flash 空间。这些文件可以位于 ``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange`` 的子目录中（例如"
" ``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange/AircraftManual``）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:66
#: b5a85e53a4c94818927030ecc4198cf3
msgid ""
"Now build as normal with OEM-CubeOrange as the board name in the "
"configuration. The default parameters, Lua scripts, and the custom firmware "
"name will be embedded appropriately."
msgstr "现在以 OEM-CubeOrange 作为配置中的板名称，按正常流程编译。默认参数、Lua 脚本和自定义固件名称将被适当嵌入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:69
#: 1e683bbed82440fe9942343cfcb47069
msgid "Alternative To Customizing hwdef.dat"
msgstr "定制 hwdef.dat 的替代方案"

#: ../../source/docs/common-oem-customizations.rst:71
#: 6cfc1e0546ff46209d7114de51fad40e
msgid ""
"Instead of creating a separate branch and modifying the hwdef file, you can "
"also insert Lua scripts or even informational files into the ROMFS of the "
"build. Simply go to the top level of your ArduPilot git checkout and create "
"a sub-folder named \"ROMFS_custom\" in the root of the source tree. Place "
"your LUA scripts in a sub-folder in this directory, named \"scripts\" (i.e. "
"the path ``ardupilot/ROMFS_custom/scripts``). You can have other sub-folders"
" for informational files and these will be included and viewable when "
"examining the @ROMFS folder with MAVFtp."
msgstr ""
"除了创建单独分支并修改 hwdef 文件外，您还可以将 Lua 脚本甚至信息文件插入到编译的 ROMFS 中。只需进入 ArduPilot git "
"检出的顶层目录，在源代码树根目录中创建名为「ROMFS_custom」的子文件夹。将 LUA 脚本放在此目录下名为「scripts」的子文件夹中（即路径"
" ``ardupilot/ROMFS_custom/scripts``）。您还可以为信息文件创建其他子文件夹，这些文件将被包含，并可在使用 MAVFtp"
" 访问 @ROMFS 文件夹时查看。"
